      "writtenOn": "2010-04-28T08:57:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Regarding the size. Yes, it specifies the size of the background (but also twice the letter size...). It says the letter to be consistent with the description of fastscroll_overlay_size in dimens.xml. Should probably have changed that one instead...\n\nThe reason it takes a resource id instead of a drawable is mostly to avoid having to have another variable for the drawable. Seems a bit strange to have one for the resource id and one for the drawable. If it\u0027s possible to do the assignments in the constructor in another way, we should skip the resource id and go with drawables instead.\n\nWhat\u0027s the guidelines regarding drawable vs resource id. Should drawables be passed around instead of id\u0027s?",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAx3///40\u003d",
      "revId": "d377bfafddc95284ff5f9fbc1857513f5967efa0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
